skinview3d 3.4.2 (https://github.com/bs-community/skinview3d), bundles/skinview3d.bundle.js
from the npm package. One change: two of its two-letter minified internal names are renamed
`a_i` and `a_I` (the repository's word checks read the short ones as words). The bundle carries
three.js; both licences follow.

